# Source-upload filter for `gcloud builds submit --config cloudbuild.yaml` (api + web
# images). Unlike the root .gcloudignore (the api's `gcloud run deploy --source .`),
# this KEEPS frontend/ — the web build's context. Each Dockerfile's .dockerignore
# (root, frontend/) still trims its own build context. Root-only dirs use a leading `/`.
.git
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env*
.vscode/
.github/
.claude/
.agents/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
a_stash/*
output/*
outputs/
.adk
**/.adk/
node_modules/
frontend/.next/
frontend/coverage/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
tests/
docs/
/experiments/
/notebook-examples/
/imgs/
/*.md
/bandit/
/bandit_serving/
/bandit_traffic/
/cloud_functions/
